OL,3,GNEWSATeens' murder trial begins over
OL,4,Apark stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been sworn in for the trial
OL,7,Fof two teenagers accused of murdering a
OL,8,F15-year-old boy.
OL,10,FLuis Guembes Quimper died in Stoke
OL,11,FPark, Guildford, on 19 January after he
OL,12,Fwas stabbed.
OL,14,FThe defendants, who were 15 and 16 at
OL,15,Fthe time of the incident, cannot be
OL,16,Fnamed because of their age.
OL,18,FThey are accused of murder, conspiracy
OL,19,Fto rob and possession of a bladed
OL,20,Farticle.
